    "test_evidence": "capability-src/audio-recording-analyze: 8 #[test] cases (every verdict, partial final window, stereo, 44.1/22.05 kHz boundaries, exact 8 MiB cap at 2098 windows and 8 MiB + 1 byte, every failure class and exit status); cargo llvm-cov functions=100%, lines=98.87%, regions=99.1%. wasm32 artifact under wasmtime with a 32 MiB memory cap: both 8 MiB extremes (8 kHz mono, 48 kHz stereo) succeed; exit statuses 10/11/12 verified. Traverse nested executor (execute_nested_capability_with_limits): exit statuses surface as 'Exited with i32 exit status N'; minimum fuel 7.1M for 1 s at 16 kHz mono, 1.83e9-1.86e9 at 8 MiB. Reused crates split lib/bin: their wasm32 builds give byte-identical stdout and exit status to the pre-split builds on 184 generated inputs. Every use_case output_example was produced by the built artifact.",
